(f729dd5 changed three screen texts; the model-text suggestions were not adopted). Arabic, French and Hindi did
change model texts (3, 6 and 6), so theirs stay "corrected"; Tamil stays "no changes". model_bundle_test expects
the corrected note. Metadata only: nothing shown changes.

